<div class="dt-builder">
  <h2>Build/Rebuild Compendiums</h2>
  <p>Foundry V14 · D&D5e 5.3.3 · 2014 rules · adjusted weights in pounds.</p>
  <p>The source catalogue defines every generated item. Multiple shop tags do not create duplicate items.</p>
  <p>Choose a Merchant Type or All Merchant Types. Preview validates source data and reports creates, updates and preserved entries. Services are shown for reference; use the Stock RollTable Builder for tables.</p>
  {{#if catalogueError}}
    <pre class="dt-warning" role="alert">{{catalogueError}}</pre>
  {{else}}
    <fieldset class="dt-builder-selection" {{#if busy}}disabled{{/if}}><legend>Build scope</legend>
      <label>Merchant Type<select data-builder-select="shop"><option value="" {{#if allShops}}selected{{/if}}>All Merchant Types</option>{{#each shops}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
      <label>Settlement<select data-builder-select="settlement">{{#each settlements}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
      <label>Category<select data-builder-select="category"><option value="" {{#if allCategories}}selected{{/if}}>All categories</option>{{#each categories}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}} · {{count}} products</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
    </fieldset>
    <p>Settlement is preview context only: the shared Item catalogue is identical across settlements. Use the RollTable Builder to filter settlement stock profiles.</p>
    {{> "modules/devils-table/templates/generation-summary.hbs"}}
    {{#if shop}}
      <details class="dt-merchant-notes">
        <summary>Merchant Notes — {{shop.name}}</summary>
        <p>{{shop.description}}</p>
        <p>Stock guidance for the builder. Notes can name future goods; they do not create items or go into the compendium.</p>
        <div class="dt-stock-tiers">
          <section><h3>Always Stocks</h3><ul>{{#each shop.merchantNotes.alwaysStocks}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul></section>
          <section><h3>Often Stocks</h3><ul>{{#each shop.merchantNotes.oftenStocks}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul></section>
          <section><h3>Rarely Stocks</h3><ul>{{#each shop.merchantNotes.rarelyStocks}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul></section>
        </div>
      </details>
    {{else}}
      <p>Select a shop to see its Merchant Notes.</p>
    {{/if}}
    <p><strong>{{scopeLabel}}</strong> — {{count}} authored items selected.</p>
    <p>Pricing: 1–9 cp everyday; 1–9 sp common; 1–24 gp equipment; 25+ gp specialist.</p>
    <p>{{#each priceBands}}{{name}}: {{count}}{{#unless @last}} · {{/unless}}{{/each}}</p>
  {{/if}}
  <fieldset {{#if busy}}disabled{{/if}}>
    <legend>GM actions</legend>
    <button type="button" data-action="preview"><i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> Validate / Preview</button>
    <button type="button" data-action="build" {{#if blocked}}disabled{{/if}}><i class="fa-solid fa-hammer" aria-hidden="true"></i> Build / Rebuild</button>
  </fieldset>
  <h3>Report</h3>
  <pre class="dt-report" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">{{report}}</pre>
  <details><summary>Last build record</summary><pre>{{lastBuild}}</pre></details>
</div>
